# --- AeroForm Suite Master GitIgnore ---

# EXCLUDE Heavy Dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/offline_packages/

# EXCLUDE Build Artifacts & Large Binaries
**/dist/
**/generated_notices/*.docx

# EXCLUDE Runtime Logs & Local Data
**/logs/
**/history.json
**/data.json (if it contains real employee data)

# INCLUDE Code & Config (Explicitly allowing .env as requested)
!**/.env
!**/.env.local
!**/config.json

# OS Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Keep Deployment Scripts
!HOST_ON_LAN.bat
!PREPARE_ALL_OFFLINE.bat
!AIR_GAP_GUIDE.md
!TROUBLESHOOTING_AND_CONFIG.md
